{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "2898d21a80f8823f8df42dbcc5db240250d46f1156675918116c8c91a75f903c", "ja": "ふぅー♪　お腹いっぱい！　茜ちゃん大満足です！\n焼きたてのお肉とご飯はなぜあんなにも合うのか……！", "zh": "呼～♪肚子好饱！小茜超满足！\n刚烤好的肉到底为什么这么下饭啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "05ae487d7b944dcab6ab2589e5725fecb75c87ce61c182be7009969117e300ef", "ja": "ファミレスとはいえお肉を食べると、みんなとやった\nバーベキューを思い出すね！　楽しかったな～♪", "zh": "虽然是在家庭餐厅，但只要吃了肉，\n就会想起和大家一起烤肉的时候！那时很开心呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "515042f952eb2ebfe9df28925f8d0cc615f25adeb224193004c970bf77373b28", "ja": "そうだな、茜は楽しそうだったな……。", "zh": "是啊，那时的茜看起来真的很开心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ceb95c5bb8c566827f2ecfe7e3a4607a9ca12d20a7a8aa22ef44fd6bce960957", "ja": "ニャ？　どうしたの、{$P$}ちゃん？\nサンサンと降りそそぐ太陽の思い出が、なぜにブルー？", "zh": "喵？怎么啦，小{$P$}？\n明明是灿烂阳光下的回忆，你怎么一脸忧郁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "6947fa5728e9eff84813f074be19e12f8f29f2a4dc05761fb844db2a9e396fa2", "ja": "『河原でバーベキュー』という、リア充イベントは\n{$P$}ちゃんにはレベルが高すぎた？", "zh": "难道『在河边烤肉』这种人生胜利组活动，\n对小{$P$}来说等级太高了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9c70ae28eb1bbdb77ff12485b050a6c92ab9743f0b4cab94d34c185b81387ad5", "ja": "違う。茜がピーマンとニンジンばかり俺に押し付けて\nくるから、ほとんど肉を食べられなかったんだ。", "zh": "不，因为茜一直把青椒和胡萝卜硬塞给我，\n所以我几乎没吃到肉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "d8fc4119de6fe44ee67b18883ee03415cad0ecef1669499887b59acb60c2a78c", "ja": "いやー、茜ちゃんは{$P$}ちゃんの\n健康を思ってね？　ベジタブルな栄養をあげようと！", "zh": "哎呀～小茜是为了小{$P$}的\n健康着想，才想让你多吸收点青菜的营养嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "30a6559913da3bb17150657bb09f775541e5f38712b2336042420d934858d08f", "ja": "決してピーマンとニンジンが嫌いなわけじゃないよ！\nあの苦味とナントモ言えぬ食感とか……好きデスヨ？", "zh": "绝对不是因为小茜讨厌青椒和胡萝卜喔！\n那苦味和难以形容的口感……小茜很喜欢唷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c03783a6e380a9c92eccc0fd663d420f024395b7ba6399139f706b4830728ae7", "ja": "好き嫌いばかりしてると、立派なオトナになれないぞ。", "zh": "要是一直挑食，可是会当不成独当一面的大人喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "8b450a706b48d1ea5b5c1890bb9cb3db4e31716f18ca3a3848ae04ba1b4b543b", "ja": "はぁ～！？　茜ちゃんもうオトナだし！　16歳だし！\nピーマンも食べようと思えば食べられなくもないし！", "zh": "啊～！？小茜已经是大人了啦！都16岁了！\n青椒这种东西，只要小茜想，也不是吃不下去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e2fee0fc431c53b572a3583bc12aed071125351ffae7be590fc2772d86b396d", "ja": "そんなイジワルなこと言うと、またキョーセイ的に\n水も滴るイイ男にするよ！　文字通りの意味でー！", "zh": "要是再一直说这种坏心眼的话，就强制让你再次化身成\n帅到滴水的好男人喔！是真的会滴水的那种──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0023_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cacdf4791287208735f405e24f831ea5d90333d3a7d8aa6051cf032d772286bd", "ja": "そうだったな、あの後、水もかけられて散々……わっ、\nこら茜！？　コップの水はやめろ、コップの水は！", "zh": "这么说来，那之后我的确被你用水泼得全身湿透……\n哇，喂！茜！？别拿杯子里的水泼我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
